  <text xml:lang="grc"><body xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0019.anagyros.dindorf1893-grc1"><div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0019.anagyros.dindorf1893-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_anagyros"><head>ΑΝΑΓΥΡΟΣ</head><div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="1" xml:id="fragment-anagyros-dindorf1893_grc1-1" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_anagyros">
            <note type="source">(1.) Etymolog. M, p. 207, 53, in v. βουκέφαλος (Gudian. p. 113, 47.)</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Μὴ κλᾶ᾽. ἐγώ σοι βουκέφαλον ὠνήσομαι.</l>
            </lg>
            <note type="commentary">καὶ πάλιν</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">Ψήχει ἠρέμα τὸν βουκέφαλον καὶ κοππατίαν.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="2" xml:id="fragment-anagyros-dindorf1893_grc1-2" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_anagyros">
            <note type="source">(2.) Photius p. 346, 16, et Suidas in v. ὀρθοπλήξ.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Ὡς δ᾽ ὀρθοπλήξ· πέφυκε γὰρ δυσγάργαλις.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="3" xml:id="fragment-anagyros-dindorf1893_grc1-3" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_anagyros">
            <note type="source">(3.) Pollux X, 74. Καὶ τὸν πνιγέα ἐπὶ ἵππου Ἀριστοφάνης ἐν Ἀναγύρῳ λέγει. Aristophanis verba sine nomine auctoris apposita sunt in Etymolog. M, p. 677, 40.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Περίθες σεαυτῷ τὸν πνιγέα.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="4" xml:id="fragment-anagyros-dindorf1893_grc1-4" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_anagyros">
            <note type="source">(4.) Pollux X, 55. Τὴν δὲ ψήκτραν – Ἀριστοφάνης ἐν Ἀναγύρῳ εἴρηκεν.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="5" xml:id="fragment-anagyros-dindorf1893_grc1-5" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_anagyros">
            <note type="source">(5.) Pollux X, 56. Στόμια δὲ πριονωτὰ ἔφη ἐν Ἀναγύρῳ Ἀριστοφάνης.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="6" xml:id="fragment-anagyros-dindorf1893_grc1-6" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_anagyros">
            <note type="source">(6.) Athenæus VIII, p. 385 f.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Εἰ μὴ παραμυθεῖ μὲ ὀψαρίοις ἑκάστοτε.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="7" xml:id="fragment-anagyros-dindorf1893_grc1-7" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_anagyros">
            <note type="source">(7.) Athenæus XIV, p. 650 e. Τῶν γὰρ ἀπυρήνων (ῥοῶν) Ἀριστοφάνης μνημονεύει ἐν Ἀναγύρῳ</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Πλὴν ἀλεύρου καὶ ῥόας.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="8" xml:id="fragment-anagyros-dindorf1893_grc1-8" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_anagyros">
            <note type="source">(8.) Photius p. 811, 15. et Suidas in ξυννένοφε</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Καὶ ξυννένοφε καὶ χειμέρια βροντᾷ μάλ᾽ εὖ.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="9" xml:id="fragment-anagyros-dindorf1893_grc1-9" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_anagyros">
            <note type="source">(9.) Photius p. 315, 22. et Suidas in ὁδοῦ παρούσης</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Ὅρμου παρόντος τὴν ἀτραπὸν κατερρύην.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="10" xml:id="fragment-anagyros-dindorf1893_grc1-10" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_anagyros">
            <note type="source">(10.) Pollux IX, 64.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Ἐν τῷ στόματι τριημιωβόλιον ἔχων.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="11" xml:id="fragment-anagyros-dindorf1893_grc1-11" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_anagyros">
            <note type="source">(11.) Pollux IX, 72.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">α. Τοῦτ᾽ αὐτὸ πράττω, δύ᾽ ὀβολὼ καὶ σύμβολον</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">ὑπὸ τὠπικλίντρῳ. β. μῶν τις αὔτ᾽ ἀνείλετο ;</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="12" xml:id="fragment-anagyros-dindorf1893_grc1-12" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_anagyros">
            <note type="source">(12.) Athenæus IV, p. 133 b.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Πρὸς θεῶν, ἔραμαι τέττιγα φαγεῖν</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">καὶ κερκώπην θηρευσαμένη</l>
              <l n="3" xml:lang="grc">καλάμῳ λεπτῷ.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="13" xml:id="fragment-anagyros-dindorf1893_grc1-13" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_anagyros">
            <note type="source">(13.) Athenæus VII, p. 301 a.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Οὐχ ἑψητῶν λοπάς ἐστιν.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="14" xml:id="fragment-anagyros-dindorf1893_grc1-14" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_anagyros">
            <note type="source">(14.) Scholiasta Avium v. 1292.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Καὶ μὴν χθές γ᾽ ἦν Πέρδιξ χωλός.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="15" xml:id="fragment-anagyros-dindorf1893_grc1-15" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_anagyros">
            <note type="source">(15.) Suidas in v. ἁπλήγιος et grammaticus Bekkeri p. 425, 20.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Ἐκ δὲ τῆς ἐμῆς χλανίδος τρεῖς ἁπληγίδας ποιῶν.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="16" xml:id="fragment-anagyros-dindorf1893_grc1-16" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_anagyros">
            <note type="source">(16.) Photius p. 387, 7. et Suidas in παραλοῦμαι</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Ἀλλὰ πάντας χρὴ παραλοῦσθαι καὶ τοὺς σπόγγους</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">ἐᾶν.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="18" xml:id="fragment-anagyros-dindorf1893_grc1-18" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_anagyros">
            <note type="source">(18.) Pollux VII, 64.</note>
            <p>Ἀναχύρωτον δὲ τὸν πηλὸν Ἀριστοφάνης ἐν Ἀναγύρῳ λέγει.</p>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="19" xml:id="fragment-anagyros-dindorf1893_grc1-19" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_anagyros">
            <note type="source">(19.) Suidas, Ἀργεῖοι φῶρες·</note>
            <p>ἐπὶ τῶν προδήλως πονηρῶν. οἱ γὰρ Ἀργεῖοι ἐπὶ κλοπῇ κωμῳδοῦνται. Ἀριστοφάνης Ἀναγύρῳ.</p>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="20" xml:id="fragment-anagyros-dindorf1893_grc1-20" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_anagyros">
            <note type="source">(20.) Pollux X, 76.</note>
            <p>Ἔξεστι δὲ αὐτὸ (vasculum vomituris porrigendum) καὶ λεβήτιον καλέσαι, καὶ σκάφην εἶπεν ἐν τῷ Ἀναγύρῳ Ἀριστοφάνης. Addit codex Falckenburgianus καὶ ἡμισκάφης δ᾽ ὡς ἐντι ἐνποδιλονίων ἐκοῦμεν.</p>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="21" xml:id="fragment-anagyros-dindorf1893_grc1-21" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_anagyros">
            <note type="source">(21.) Pollux X, 114.</note>
            <p>Τὸ ὑπόθημα τοῦ ὅλμου ὑφόλμιον, ὡς Ἀριστοφάνης ἐν Ἀναγύρῳ λέγει.</p>
          </div>
        </div></body></text></TEI>
